{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出釋籤第六卷，蓋然師搜括十妙大旨，直申開顯一理，示所詮極致，\n故自立此名耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下問答疑中辨之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下示六即不二珠。文云一一門下，以六即撿之，總述於\n此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是性德，下五修德。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曾從經中，及從善知識所，聞佛名字，故云名字即佛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此有五品位，一一念信解，即圓一心三諦也。二、兼能受持大乘經解典。三、復廣為眾生說法〔正〕。四、能說法\n兼行六度。五、事理心融，正行六度。五位俱修，圓行同名，觀行即佛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開顯\n聲聞案位，與六根淨位同，故用領解珠也。若進入者，即同分真，非此位也。此有十倍心位，至第七心，是正六根\n淨位。十位俱似分真，同名相似即佛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "獻珠表得圓解，開佛知見，非舉譬也。此有四十一位，皆破無明，\n證實相，而智用不無優劣。十住名開，十行名示，十迴向名悟，十地等覺名入。四十一位，本末究竟，同名分真即\n位。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此唯\n妙覺位耳。上況引諸經明六即之，文不出經，自嫌繁故也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此指眾生無始恒造，非謂中間忽然而造，名之為立也。今舉此\n兩句，為下清淨緣起張本。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "淨名疏云：法性即無明，故法性無住；無明\n即法性，故無明無明。今但直示體耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上法譬雙明染淨，下先明\n染，後明淨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂無明業\n緣也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經前方便三修。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上染緣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "教行緣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即前苦報"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即前癡惑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即前業相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻法\n身也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻般若也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻解脫也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻前癡惑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻前業相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻前苦報"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四智對四教，如玄義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下翻前地水火風色香味觸三界依正"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真法界性地，真空元我相色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真法界性火，真空無相觸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真法界性風，真空無相味"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真法界性水，真空無相香"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一體依正"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廣如玄義圓五行中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此第三人具四悉也。然四悉不必定須次第隨機，宜聞即用耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南岳．天台等者，高僧輩是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "備如觀音玄義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遲疾如前三種人也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "漸次者，亦解圓理，但是行漸，謂次第修於四禪八定，〔現〕練熏修，及修九種大禪等，不從圓發，故名漸\n次。不定者，亦依漸門而修發，不從圓發頓，或發漸，或前後互發，故名不定，由宿習漸頓種熟故爾。此又不同圓\n發中十境，自是煩惱等互發之相耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四三昧者，\n一常行，二常坐，三半行半坐，四非行非坐。此第四亦名隨自意，即通於善惡舉動。常三昧非專一事，四種俱稱。\n三昧者，三此言正，昧此云定。又三之言明，昧之言靜。明是觀體，靜是止體，即妙定妙慧也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如比丘得四禪，\n謂得四果之類是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論文見在，尋之可見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三釋語異，其意大同。今欲令調\n了修性，故備述三義，仍引經證之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開合之相文中自解"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "思文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "老子云：大音希聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此文已求多古本釋籤抹勘開，即仍與諸傳教碩德評定。\n訖今世有別行之本，其間二十餘字不同，蓋三寫成就耳。覽者未審，請徵古本釋籤對之，無致多惑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "全在下卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初文分三：初、結示前章教觀宗要，又二：初、\n略示教觀旁正，又二：初、教正故意周，又二：初、述所談之本意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如感為他，應為自，互名能所。神通說法偏從能立，眷屬利益偏從所立，此\n亦大槩各舉名數而已，至下建立所從中更辨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、故凡下，舉用義以釋成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "藏．通．別．圓"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "頓．漸．秘密．不定"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二觀旁，故從略。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、總歎十妙宗旨，又三：初、詮旨咸妙意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、該叔化意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、覽教成觀意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、明後段法義無殊，又二：初中明迹本離合以顯無殊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二明五章總別，以顯無殊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三：初、曉教行旨歸，彰所述之意。又二：初、敘教行旨歸。又三：初、明教理融妙。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、明觀行依憑。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、歎功成道着。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二故更下彰所述三意，又二：初標立門所由"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二辨名義歸趣，又三：初依義立世名符妙意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二門門六即簡濫意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三指廣申略結要意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初總敘一期不二宗旨訖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二、別立十門歷法解釋，又分三：初、標列門名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、建立所從"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、依正釋，分十：初、色心不二，又二：初、標。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、釋，又二：初、辨釋總別，又三：初、通標境具總別。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、何\n者下，歷境顯示別相。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、既智下，攝別入總，正示宗歸。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、結顯不二，又三：初、明即總三別造體恒回"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此不勞辨〔內〕〔搏〕緣慮等心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二是則下，\n明不二而二，舉一全收。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、故知下，結示己他三無差別。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初門訖。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、內外不二，又三：初、標。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、釋，又二：初、辨釋內外，又二：初、通標內外。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、別釋內外，又二：初、釋內外，又三：初、明境體本妙。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、明境觀雙泯。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、色心下，顯帝網依正。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、釋內，又二：初、外境亡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、唯內下，內體顯。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、是則下，結顯不二，又二：初、心性融攝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、十方下，生佛泯同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、結所從。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二門訖。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、修性不二，又三：初、標。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、釋，又四：初、標性因，又二：初、雙標修性，又二：初、標性。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、性難下，標修。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、辨相成相即。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、顯修中逆順，又四：初、示逆順。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、會事理。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、斥謬解。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四、顯真修。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、辨修性離合，又二：初、正明離合，又二：初、明離合相。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、明離合所以。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、寄喻融通。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四、結顯不二，又二：初、重示理體。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、達無下，正彰不二。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、結所從。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第三門訖。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四、因果不二，又三：初、標。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、釋，又三：初、標不二之宗。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、徵難釋成，又\n二：初、徵。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、釋，又二：初、釋因果不二，又二：初、迷了事別，因果名殊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、只依下，理顯情亡，性相俱泯。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、辨惑智淺深，又二：初、正明惑智淺深。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上二種入非今文親疎之人，恐有相濫，因而明之耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是今文\n親疎人也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二喻顯智斷因果，又二：初總喻四法性虗。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、別顯事虗理\n實，又二：初、重提二喻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、像實正合歸。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、結\n顯不二，又三：初、正結不二。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二〔、汙〕謬顯真。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、所以下，重示融即。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、結所從。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第四\n門訖。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五、染淨不二，又三：初、標。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、釋，又四：初、明法界〔像〕起熾然染淨，又二：初、明染淨本。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、示\n染淨相。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、明即用之體，非染唯淨，又二：初、立喻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、三千下，念顯。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、三千下，約位簡濫，又二：初、辨功能卷淨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、示行法勸修。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四、不動下，結顯不二。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、結所從。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第五門訖。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六、依、正不二，又三：初、標。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、釋，又三：初、明所因。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、以\n三下，辨行相，又二：初、正釋。二、而不二之相，又二：初、辨依、正。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、依、正下，示不二。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、是\n\n則下，約位釋簡，又二：初、約凡位理具釋。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、約生佛理同\n釋。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、結顯不二，又三：初、結成不二。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、是則下，融難思。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、若非下，重示理本。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、結所從。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第六門訖。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七、自他不二，又三：初、標。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、釋，又三：初、法正辨，又三：初、明理性三千為自他本二：初、標定義宗；二、物\n機下，明能化所化身土必融。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、眾生下，辨機應所由，忻赴無\n爽。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、寄喻重明，又三：初、順喻\n應道交，又二：初、正喻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、結釋。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、形事下，反喻因緣未會，又二：\n初、喻機未會。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、喻應未彰。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、總結略今。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、應知下，結顯\n所司，又二：初、示所因，二、方能下，彰他用。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、結所從。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第七門訖。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八、三業不二，又三：初、標。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、釋，又二：初、標三輪。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、正釋不二，又二：初、約身口二業各辨不二，又二：初、\n標身口。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、二身下，辨不二，又二：初、明二而不二。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、若准下，明不\n二而二。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、身尚下，約三輪一體總辨不二，又二：初、約果用釋，又二：初、辨三輪化用。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、豈耶下，釋成不二。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、果用下，約因\n理釋，又二：初、舉果例成。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、乘法顯相，又二：初、明果必由因，又二：初、示所依理本。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、辨所成果德。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、顯因理本具。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、結所從。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第八門訖。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九、權實不二，又三：初、標。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、釋，又三：初、總標機應。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、亦由下，辨釋所由，又三：初、明因理常然；二、至果下，明果由因立；三、此即下，正示化方。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、對說下，結顯不二。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、結\n所從。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第九門訖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十、受潤不二，又三：初、標。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、釋，又三：初、明受潤相，又二：初、明差而無差，熏習有異。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、性雖下，辨能化所化，權實俱空。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、然由下，明感應由。又二：初、正辨所由。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、物機下，宜同法界。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、故知下，結顯不二。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、結所從。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十門訖。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第三、融通文旨，結意歸宗。又二：初、融通文旨。又二：初、辨能依十門，初後相收。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、故使下，明所依十妙，始終理。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二、結意歸宗。又二：初、物結所述。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二會歸玄旨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "私曰：顯要記上卷，慧心、僧都破之。"}
